 \"She thinks she's all that.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_51","text":"They all picked on me for my stutter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_52","text":"Who did?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_53","text":"My classmates.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_54","text":"I was the same back then as I am now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_55","text":"Pint-sized, a loner, and a crybaby.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_risk","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_56","text":"But when I became a Nikke, I was surrounded by people who supported me. I became strong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_57","text":"I thought I would improve as a person as well...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_58","text":"but I failed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_59","text":"No, you didn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_60","text":"Thanks, but I'm well aware that I'm a lost cause.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_61","text":"In fact, a few days ago, I was at Royal Road shopping for a present for Emma, and I ran into some of my old classmates.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_62","text":"If I'm being honest, I wanted to hide. But I didn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_63","text":"I never did anything wrong to them. I should be able to confront them with my head held high.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_64","text":"The moment they saw me, they stared at me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_65","text":"\"Hey pipsqueak. Long time no see. How's life being a machine?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RoyalRoad","bgArt":"royalroad","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_66","text":"You must love it, 'cause you don't have to have any friends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_67","text":"Then they laughed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_68","text":"At that moment, I was consumed with rage. It took all I had not to kill them then and there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_69","text":"But I'm a Nikke. I can't do such a thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_70","text":"Instead, I told them that I wasn't alone. That I did have friends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_71","text":"You know what they said to me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_72","text":"\"Your squadmates don't count, you pathetic loser.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RoyalRoad","bgArt":"royalroad","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_73","text":"\"Don't you know anyone else?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_74","text":"\"You're lying. If you actually have friends, why don't you show us?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_75","text":"I wasn't able to say a word.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_03_76","text":"I couldn't be angry. I couldn't even cry like I usually do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_